# oracle: pair_style dsmc (docs.lammps.org/pair_dsmc.html) on a dilute two-species gas: 512 atoms in a simple cubic
# lattice, cells of at most 2.5, weighting 2000, the collision cross sections of pair_coeff, the RanMars stream seeded
# 34387, velocities recomputed every 10 steps from 20 samples; the collisions change the velocities inside the force
# evaluation, so ke, press and the atom velocities follow the native random draws. Native: installed lmp (b332f28).
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 5.9e-16, atoms 0.
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units           lj
atom_style      atomic
lattice         sc 0.1
region          box block 0 8 0 8 0 8
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 box
set             group all type/fraction 2 0.5 4321
mass            1 1.0
mass            2 2.0
velocity        all create 1.0 4242
pair_style      dsmc 2.5 34387 2000 1.0 10 20
pair_coeff      1 1 1.0
pair_coeff      1 2 0.8
pair_coeff      2 2 1.2
fix             1 all nve
timestep        0.005
thermo_style    custom step ke press pe
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          20
run             100
